            <ArticleTitle>Multiple coronary arteriovenous fistulas associated with polymyositis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>58-61</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of a 60-year-old female presenting a histologically proven polymyositis with multiple coronary arteriocameral fistulas draining into the left ventricle. The exact pathogenesis of coronary artery fistulas and their relation to polymyositis are not clear.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
